  "described": {
    "alt_text": "A square painting of bubble letters reading Danger Zone, Home Base, Magic Bear Fly and Super Power around a blue bear leaping with a sword, in flat purple, orange and green.",
    "description": "A square acrylic painting on wood. Bubble letters in purple, orange, green and pink fill the frame: DANGER ZONE across the top, HOME BASE in a yellow star burst at upper left, MAGIC BEAR FLY and SUPER POWER through the middle, and FLY and ROUTE at right. A blue bear figure with a white face and red mouth leaps across the lower right on a white cloud; a small orange creature with a red bulb nose and an arm holding a stick sits at lower left among grey smoke puffs. The colours are flat and the outlines thick.",
    "impression": "A superhero splash page: the bear has a home base, a danger zone and a super power, and the picture is the moment it launches. The lettering works as sound effects. It is cheerful in a loud, kids on a sugar high way.",
